easymd-dsh
==========

This directory is the DeepSeek Harness distribution layer of the easymd project:
https://github.com/Rimagination/easymd/tree/main/dsh-plugin

It contains:

  * index.js / cordis.patch.yml — the DSH bundle that registers easymd's
    render / lint / parse / extract capabilities as native tools and registers
    the easymd skill;
  * lib/easymd-markdown.mjs — a single-file ESM build of this repository's
    Markdown pipeline (src/lib/markdown/** and src/themes/**), produced by
    dsh-build/build.mjs with esbuild;
  * skills/easymd/** — a copy of this repository's skills/easymd directory.

Everything in this directory is part of the easymd work, so it carries the
repository's license: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0-only).
See LICENSE.

The Corresponding Source is the easymd repository itself:

  * https://github.com/Rimagination/easymd — full source, including
    dsh-build/ (how lib/easymd-markdown.mjs is produced) and skills/easymd/;
  * the exact commit used for a given release is recorded in the git tag
    (dsh-v<version>) and can be rebuilt with:

      pnpm install
      pnpm dsh:build

